00:06:07,500 --> 00:06:13,500
Your most terrifying nightmare and your most frightening
reality are about to meet on the streets.

2
00:12:15,000 --> 00:12:21,000
Tales from the Hood is a horror, crime, thriller
film directed by Rusty Cundieff.

3
00:18:22,500 --> 00:18:28,500
A strange mortician tells four horrific tales to three drug
dealers that he traps in their local funeral parlor.

4
00:24:30,000 --> 00:24:36,000
Mr. Simms (segment "Welcome to My Mortuary"), played by Clarence Williams III.

5
00:30:37,500 --> 00:30:43,500
Stack (segment "Welcome to My Mortuary"), played by Joe Torry.

6
00:36:45,000 --> 00:36:51,000
Ball (segment "Welcome to My Mortuary"), played by De'Aundre Bonds.

7
00:42:52,500 --> 00:42:58,500
Bulldog (segment "Welcome to My Mortuary"), played by Samuel Monroe Jr..

8
