Strom (segment "Rogue Cop Revelation"), played by Wings Hauser.

9
00:55:07,500 --> 00:55:13,500
Martin Moorehouse (segment "Rogue Cop Revelation"), played by Tom Wright.

10
01:01:15,000 --> 01:01:21,000
Tales from the Hood is a 1995 American black horror anthology film directed by Rusty Cundieff (who also wrote the film with Darin Scott) and starring Corbin
Bernsen, Rosalind Cash, Rusty Cundieff, David Alan Grier, Anthony Griffith, Wings Hauser, Paula Jai Parker, Joe Torry, and Clarence Williams III.

11
01:07:22,500 --> 01:07:28,500
The film presents four short urban-themed horror stories based on problems that affect the
African-American community: police corruption, domestic abuse, racism, and gang violence.

12
01:13:30,000 --> 01:13:36,000
These are presented within a frame story of three drug dealers buying some
"found" drugs from an eccentric and story-prone funeral director.

13
01:19:37,500 --> 01:19:43,500
The film was met with mixed reviews upon release but
has since gained a cult following.

14
01:25:45,000 --> 01:25:51,000
The film explores themes of prison, child abuse,
police brutality, ku klux klan, ghetto.

15
01:31:52,500 --> 01:31:58,500
The tone is lighthearted and dark and emotional.
